 .../target/libdvdcss/LIBDVDCSS-VERSION        |  7 ++--
 .../libdvdread/01-all-disableopendir.patch    | 33 ++++++++++---------
 .../libdvdread/02-all-disablesymlink.patch    |  2 +-
 .../target/libdvdread/LIBDVDREAD-VERSION      |  7 ++--
 5 files changed, 28 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

